1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,720
Two hundred roles, Hunter. The board
wants your signature by end of
quarter.

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:08,731
<i>Two hundred people. I don't know one
of their names.</i>

3
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:12,642
Start with Design. They're…
sentimental.

4
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:14,313
Give me two weeks.

5
00:00:14,433 --> 00:00:15,451
For what?

6
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:19,180
<i>To meet who I'm firing.</i>

7
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:24,348
<i>Nobody here knows my face. I skipped
every photo shoot. Finally paying off.</i>

8
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:33,729
Okay, I have to ask. Same protein bar?
Three days running?

9
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:36,455
<i>She's counting. Who counts?</i>

10
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,694
It's got… everything you need.

11
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:45,079
It's chalk. You're eating chalk in a
wrapper.

12
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:49,855
<i>New guy. Nice watch. Sad lunch.
Something's off.</i>

13
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:53,623
Here. My tía always makes too much.
Don't make it weird.

14
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:59,330
<i>Friday. Promotion review. Do not cry
at your desk, Reyes.</i>

15
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:02,588
So. Weekend. What'd you do?

16
00:01:03,150 --> 00:01:05,455
Caught up on some… stuff.

17
00:01:05,575 --> 00:01:06,460
Work stuff?

18
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:07,511
…Yeah.

19
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:10,291
And the weekend before?

20
00:01:10,411 --> 00:01:11,532
You're doing a thing.

21
00:01:12,150 --> 00:01:14,013
I'm totally doing a thing.

22
00:01:14,650 --> 00:01:17,771
When's the last time you did something
you'd never done before?

23
00:01:19,650 --> 00:01:22,901
<i>Signed a billion-dollar deal in a
parking garage. Doesn't count.</i>

24
00:01:23,650 --> 00:01:25,363
…Define 'something.'

25
00:01:25,483 --> 00:01:28,880
Oh no. You're a project.

26
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:32,970
<i>Under forty bucks. Fun. Zero protein
bars.</i>

27
00:01:35,650 --> 00:01:38,499
Friday night. My treat. It's a
Groupon, relax.

28
00:01:39,650 --> 00:01:43,038
I'm not really a… I don't really do
stuff.

29
00:01:43,650 --> 00:01:46,636
<i>Say no. You might be firing her
department. Say no.</i>

30
00:01:47,650 --> 00:01:50,134
Yeah. I got that from the chalk.

31
00:01:50,650 --> 00:01:51,696
…Okay.

32
00:01:54,650 --> 00:01:58,297
<i>One date. Then I tell her. Then I fix
this.</i>

33
00:02:00,650 --> 00:02:01,414
<i>Somehow.</i>

34
00:02:05,650 --> 00:02:06,848
There you are! Mr. Co—

35
00:02:07,650 --> 00:02:08,940
<i>Mister… what?</i>
